### Catalogar um jogo
POST http://localhost:3000/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hollow Knight",
  "genre": "Metroidvania",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseDate": "2017-02-24",
  "description": "Reino de insetos em ruinas.",
  "hoursToBeat": 40
}

> {% client.global.set("gameId", response.body.id); %}

### Duracao negativa: barrada na borda, responde 400
POST http://localhost:3000/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Jogo impossivel",
  "genre": "Metroidvania",
  "platform": "PC",
  "releaseDate": "2020-01-01",
  "description": "x",
  "hoursToBeat": -5
}

### O que jogar agora: ranqueia o backlog e diz por que
GET http://localhost:3000/games/backlog

### So as tres primeiras sugestoes
GET http://localhost:3000/games/backlog?limit=3

### Limite invalido: responde 400
GET http://localhost:3000/games/backlog?limit=0

### Listar tudo
GET http://localhost:3000/games

### Filtrar por plataforma
GET http://localhost:3000/games?platform=PC

### Filtrar por plataforma e status ao mesmo tempo
GET http://localhost:3000/games?platform=PC&status=backlog

### Buscar por id
GET http://localhost:3000/games/{{gameId}}

### Avaliar
PATCH http://localhost:3000/games/{{gameId}}/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 9.5 }

### Marcar como zerado
PATCH http://localhost:3000/games/{{gameId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "completed" }

### Nota fora da faixa: a regra e do dominio, responde 422
PATCH http://localhost:3000/games/{{gameId}}/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 42 }

### Payload invalido: barrado na borda, responde 400
POST http://localhost:3000/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "genre": "Metroidvania"
}

### Id que nao existe: responde 404
GET http://localhost:3000/games/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Remover
DELETE http://localhost:3000/games/{{gameId}}
